# The share of lines in src/ the suite has to keep reaching, in percent.
#
# Not a target somebody picked — 90% would be that, and a number nobody agreed
# to is a number that gets waived the first time it is inconvenient. This is a
# fact the tree already earned, and the only thing it forbids is going
# backwards: new code arrives with a test, or this line is lowered on purpose
# and the commit that lowers it says why.
#
